<<<
sky blue. The name of the colour is sky blue; the adjective blue qualified by sky becomes sky-blue:
===
**sky blue.** The name of the colour is *sky blue*; the adjective *blue* qualified by *sky* becomes *sky-blue*:
>>>

<<<
sky blue will be best; a sky-blue tie; her eyes are sky-blue. See HYPHENS.
===
*sky blue will be best; a sky-blue tie; her eyes are sky-blue.* See ^^HYPHENS^^.
>>>

<<<
skyer. For spelling see SKIER.
===
**skyer.** For spelling see ^^SKIER^^.
